        "title": "Daneben, danach, dafür …",
        "de": "Worauf warten Sie? Ich warte darauf. Sie freut sich darüber. Anna fragt danach. Ich denke daran. Er bittet darum. Die Tablette ist dafür. Das Thermometer liegt daneben.",
        "en": "What are you waiting for? I am waiting for it. She is glad about it. Anna asks about it. I am thinking of it. He asks for it. The tablet is for it. The thermometer is lying beside it."
